course: dictionary
lesson: 492
title: Asia, the biggest continent
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: A continent is a huge piece of land. Asia is the biggest of the seven continents, and it has more people than any other. Asia is a proper noun, a name for one particular place, so it starts with a capital letter, just like London or Tom.
explain: Look at the words around it for clues. «Long ago, in parts of Africa and Asia, small shiny cowrie shells were used as money.» Asia sits next to Africa, so it must be another big place on the map, not a city or a person.
explain: You will also see Asia in phrases like across Asia, South Asia and East Asia. The word before it, such as South or East, names a smaller part of the big continent.
fact: Asia is the biggest of the seven continents.
fact: Asia has more people than any other continent.
fact: China, India, Japan, Korea, Indonesia and Thailand are all in Asia.
fact: Asia covers about 44 million square kilometres, almost a third of all the land on Earth.
fact: India and China alone hold more than a third of all the people in the world.
exercise: Which of these is a country in Asia? | Canada | Egypt | Brazil | *Japan
exercise: «Asia is the largest continent, with about 44 million square kilometres.» Which continent is the largest of the seven? | *Asia | Africa | Australia | Europe
exercise: «The common pheasant in British fields was brought from Asia long ago for hunting.» Find and copy the word that names a continent. | fields | Pheasant | British | *Asia
test: «Mount Everest is the highest mountain in Asia.» On which continent is Mount Everest? | Europe | *Asia | Africa | Australia
test: Ella says, «Asia is a country, like France.» Is she right? | Yes, Asia is the same as China | No, Asia is a city in China | Yes, Asia is one small country | *No, Asia is a continent, and it holds many countries
exam: Why does «Asia» start with a capital letter? | Because it is a long word | Because it starts every sentence in a text | *Because it is the name of one particular place | Because it is the name of an animal
